    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Grimes are delighted to welcome No. 65 Corballis Demesne to the market. This well presented two bedroom, two bathroom apartment is ideally positioned on the first floor and extends to approximately 68 sq. m. (732 sq. ft.) of well proportioned accommodation. The property briefly comprises an entrance hall, two spacious double bedrooms, both benefiting from carpet flooring and built-in wardrobes. The principal bedroom features an en-suite bathroom with a tiled shower cubicle and W.H.B. The second bedroom has use of the main family bathroom, which is fitted with a shower over bath, W.H.B., tiled flooring and tiled bath surround.\nThe bright and spacious living/dining room features carpet flooring, a large picture window overlooking a pleasant green area and a patio door providing access to the south facing balcony. The kitchen is fitted with a single oven and electric hob and benefits from tiled flooring and a tiled splashback.\nFurther features include gas fired central heating, double glazed windows, designated parking to the front behind secure gates, a private south facing balcony and a strong B rated Building Energy Rating. The property is ideally located in the heart of Ratoath, with the village centre and Main Street just a short stroll away. Ratoath offers an excellent range of amenities including cafs, restaurants, pubs, supermarkets, shops, schools, sports and recreational facilities, all within easy reach. The property also benefits from excellent transport links, providing convenient access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas.\nThis is an ideal opportunity for first time buyers, downsizers or investors seeking a well located apartment in a popular and established development.\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate what this property has to offer.\n\nEntrance Hallway - 1.2m (3'11) x 6.5m (21'4)\nCarpet floor.\n\nLounge / Dining Room - 6.7m (22'0) x 3.58m (11'9)\nCarpet floor, access to balcony.\n\nKitchen - 2.28m (7'6) x 2.09m (6'10)\nRange of floor eye level fitted press units with tiled splashback. Integrated single oven, electric hob extractor fan. Plumbed for dishwasher, washing machine tumble dryer. Tiled floor.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.28m (10'9) x 3.9m (12'10)\nTo front with carpet floor built in wardrobes.\n\nEnsuite - 0.88m (2'11) x 3.01m (9'11)\nComprising w.c. w.h.b. with vanity unit shower cubicle with power shower. FulTiled floor partially tiled walls. Heated towel rail.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.62m (11'11) x 2.93m (9'7)\nTo rear with carpet floor built in wardrobes.\n\nMain Bathroom - 2.17m (7'1) x 1.83m (6'0)\nComprising w.c., w.h.b., bath with shower attachment. Tiled floor partially tiled walls.\n\n\nwhat3words /// compensation.cased.fielder\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
